{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12352","headline":"酬刘起居卧病见寄 · 钱起","name":"酬刘起居卧病见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"承颜看彩服，不觉别丹墀。\n味道能忘病，过庭更学诗。\n缭垣多画戟，远岫入书帷。\n竹静携琴处，林香让果时。\n声同叨眷早，交澹在年衰。\n更枉兼金赠，难爲继组词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}